{"title":"호랑수월가","artist":"나래(Narae) / 작곡·작사 상록수","date":"2026-08-04","sourceId":"14524675:059","sourceHash":"eafd7bcd99ab922f7151064fa5c214201b3a1786133530322034d0280ed877e9","duration":312.82,"cues":[{"id":"1","start":25.894949,"end":30.413837,"text":"흐르는 저 하늘을 물어 채는 범처럼","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":30.493818,"end":35.112681,"text":"태산에 날아들어 숨어드는 새처럼","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":35.192662,"end":39.611575,"text":"동산을 뛰고 뛰어가는 강아지처럼","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":39.691555,"end":44.110468,"text":"온 산에 풍물 막을 내리네","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":44.190448,"end":48.609362,"text":"바람은 지친 끝에 밤에 몸을 뉘이네","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":48.689342,"end":53.20823,"text":"별빛은 아득하니 은하수를 내리네","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":53.288211,"end":57.807099,"text":"차가운 밤하늘에 세상이 젖어 가네","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":57.887079,"end":62.106042,"text":"그리워 홀로 타령을 하자","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":62.186022,"end":66.504959,"text":"흘러가라 사랑, 사랑아","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":66.58494,"end":71.303779,"text":"덧없이 피고 떨어지는 꽃송아","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":71.383759,"end":75.502746,"text":"애닲구나 가락, 가락아","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":75.582727,"end":81.581251,"text":"눈물에 떨어진 별을 헤네","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":82.780956,"end":86.999918,"text":"푸른 달아, 오랜 고운 내 달아","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":87.079898,"end":91.898713,"text":"비친 내 손에 내려다오","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":91.978693,"end":96.09768,"text":"은색 소매 내 곁에 두른 채로","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":96.17766,"end":101.176431,"text":"한 번만 타는 입을 축여다오","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":101.256411,"end":105.195442,"text":"푸른 달아, 다시 없을 내 달아","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":105.275423,"end":110.194213,"text":"뻗은 손끝에 닿아다오","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":110.274193,"end":114.39318,"text":"달빛만이 흘러 바다가 되고","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":114.47316,"end":120.471685,"text":"지쳐 전하지 못하는 수월가","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":121.971316,"end":126.290253,"text":"고요한 바다 위로 내 노래가 떠 간다","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":126.370234,"end":130.839134,"text":"소리도 부끄러워 숨죽이고 떠 간다","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":130.919115,"end":135.587966,"text":"달빛에 젖은 몸을 내놓고서 떠 간다","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":135.667947,"end":140.08686,"text":"한낮이 비쳐 오를 때까지","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":140.16684,"end":144.585753,"text":"풍성한 가지 끝에 걸쳐 있던 연으로","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":144.665733,"end":149.084646,"text":"바람에 떨어져서 표류하던 잎으로","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":149.164627,"end":153.833478,"text":"물 위에 갈 데 없는 낡은 길을 짓다가","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":153.913458,"end":158.082433,"text":"그립고 슬퍼 눈을 감으네","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":158.162413,"end":162.481351,"text":"달아, 달아, 애달픈 달아","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":162.561331,"end":167.180195,"text":"피었다 이내 숨어 버릴 허상아","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":167.260175,"end":171.479138,"text":"시리구나 세월, 세월아","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":171.559118,"end":177.557642,"text":"나날을 헤면서 현을 뜯네","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":178.757347,"end":183.076285,"text":"푸른 달아, 오랜 고운 내 달아","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"34","start":183.156265,"end":187.775129,"text":"비친 내 손에 내려다오","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"35","start":187.855109,"end":191.974096,"text":"은색 소매 내 곁에 두른 채로","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"36","start":192.054076,"end":196.972867,"text":"한 번만 타는 입을 축여다오","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"37","start":197.052847,"end":201.271809,"text":"푸른달아, 다시 없을 내 달아","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"38","start":201.351789,"end":205.970653,"text":"뻗은 손끝에 닿아다오","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"39","start":206.050634,"end":210.369571,"text":"달빛만이 흘러 바다가 되고","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"40","start":210.449552,"end":216.448076,"text":"지쳐 전하지 못하는 수월가","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"41","start":217.047928,"end":221.266891,"text":"(나나나나-나나, 나나나나-나나)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"42","start":221.346871,"end":225.765784,"text":"(나나나나-나나-나나나나-나나)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"43","start":225.845764,"end":230.364653,"text":"(나나나나-나나, 나나나나-나나)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"44","start":230.444633,"end":236.443158,"text":"(나나나나-나나-나나나나-나)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"45","start":238.34269,"end":242.361702,"text":"서로 가자, 굽이굽이 쳐 가자","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"46","start":242.441682,"end":247.060546,"text":"하늘에 닿을 너머까지","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"47","start":247.140526,"end":251.509451,"text":"밤아 가라, 훠이훠이 가거라","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"48","start":251.589432,"end":256.408246,"text":"산 위에 걸린 저 달은 태평가","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"49","start":256.488227,"end":260.557226,"text":"서로 가자, 굽이굽이 쳐 가자","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"50","start":260.637206,"end":265.555996,"text":"새벽에 닿을 너머까지","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"51","start":265.635977,"end":269.704976,"text":"달빛만이 흘러 바다가 되고","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"52","start":269.784956,"end":274.653758,"text":"지쳐 전하지 못하는 수월가","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"53","start":274.733739,"end":279.052676,"text":"하늘을 보며 그리는 풍류가","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"54","start":279.132657,"end":285.33,"text":"손으로 잡을 수 없는 나의 수월가","translation":"","kind":"lyric"}],"candidates":[],"reviewStatus":"draft"}